      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm In support of the idea but I would rather ask to just make the UUID available because it's not private information at least as of today I can just go to the VRChat website click on any of my friends profile and copy the UUID from the url so it's not private info and it would make uniquely identifying a user way easier in udon",
      "viewerReactions": null,
